# The build and runtime stages copy only the Warden's sources and the
# licences (packaging/container/Containerfile); the test stage takes the
# repository, as the suites read its root (test-v1180's Python suites).
# Nothing built on the host goes in: each stage builds from source (and runs
# `make clean` first, should anything slip through), and nothing private.
.git
.claude
.env
.env.*
*.local
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.log
**/*.ipynb
**/*-intercept.py
**/*_intercept.py
